--- !u!114 &1159144441
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1159144439}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: The legends of the magical land of Farrun have been stirring the minds
    of sages for many years. After all, it was created by the Old Gods and hidden
    from prying eyes by a magic dome. These ancient lands are full of magic and inhabited
    by creatures that the elven eye has never seen. Farrun would have continued to
    be a fiction if a bright star had not fallen from the sky, which destroyed the
    magic dome. Needless to say, the leaders of the Elven nations immediately declared
    their rights to Farrun. Someone needs a central White castle where the great
    dragon Ebrung sleeps, someone seeks to capture magic towers that give the owners
    the ability to teleport their warriors, and someone just needs to expand the
    size of their empire. However, there is one small difficulty. The new gods are
    not very happy to see Farrun torn apart by the Elven rulers, so they have sent
    their best heroes to confront the elves. Mistress of Time, Eldagar and Atranax,
    the mighty servants of the new gods, have already arrived in the legendary land
    and are raising a rebellion of the local peoples against the elven rulers.
